{"id": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart:offset-4884", "file": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart", "location": "offset-4884", "text": "'Two quiet minutes either side, so there is a before and an after to '\n'compare. Nothing is said until about $kBreathingEffectPairs '\n'sessions have both.'", "sha256": "7297bdfc2dc9bad1f31c6f57dfdc419991a96f378cb5667a45d395e219d3cdb9", "kind": "dart", "start": 4884, "end": 5067, "line": 116}
{"id": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart:offset-5078", "file": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart", "location": "offset-5078", "text": "'Measured on ${e.pairs} '\n'${e.pairs == 1 ? '", "sha256": "aac350c6534b2eb569f62bbccab4e98415d171fdc4a32e85f34cf3fb2ec419bd", "kind": "dart", "start": 5078, "end": 5137, "line": 119}
{"id": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart:offset-5157", "file": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart", "location": "offset-5157", "text": "'} so far. About $left '\n'more before there is enough to compare.'", "sha256": "679b2abb2f4c04927bc1f65a66a4b859cc8f7fb31546730d2deed903de034d4e", "kind": "dart", "start": 5157, "end": 5237, "line": 120}
{"id": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart:offset-5275", "file": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart", "location": "offset-5275", "text": "'No detectable change across ${e.pairs} sessions. Your resting '\n'variability afterwards looks like it did before.'", "sha256": "6f381715a4216e537be09c770f15a21770cde2184bd59024996a3ff3c7d2dc93", "kind": "dart", "start": 5275, "end": 5398, "line": 124}
{"id": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart:offset-5437", "file": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart", "location": "offset-5437", "text": "'After your sessions, your resting variability is usually higher for a '\n'few minutes. Across ${e.pairs} sessions.'", "sha256": "7f46f0be39f3f5fc03f61ef018e28a4d2da70092346fc681f77d3ecc5847541b", "kind": "dart", "start": 5437, "end": 5564, "line": 128}
{"id": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart:offset-5573", "file": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart", "location": "offset-5573", "text": "'After your sessions, your resting variability is usually lower for a '\n'few minutes. Across ${e.pairs} sessions.'", "sha256": "1a698608762f82d2c5da120982d7732b1b00f63c2030a0bdcf3aee01084ae2cb", "kind": "dart", "start": 5573, "end": 5699, "line": 130}
{"id": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart:offset-5982", "file": "lib/stress/session_effect.dart", "location": "offset-5982", "text": "'You knew you were doing it, and you also sat still for ten minutes — that '\n'on its own would do something, and this cannot tell the two apart. It is '\n'a few minutes either side, not a lasting change.'", "sha256": "dc36b8fb420d175f0910f92f58518dd6ab90bc8a4cd6cb67186c7ed1c84aea23", "kind": "dart", "start": 5982, "end": 6193, "line": 139}
